  <string name="pdf_keep_title">Keep it safe</string>
  <string name="pdf_keep">If you forget your password, this code is the only way back into your account. The server keeps only a scrambled copy, so nobody can tell it to you again. Store it somewhere private: a password manager, or printed and put away. Anyone with this code and your username can set a new password for your account.</string>
  <string name="pdf_use_title">To use it</string>
  <string name="pdf_use">1. Open Perch, choose Sign in, then \"Forgot your password?\".\n2. Enter your username, this code and a new password.\n3. Your other devices are signed out. You can make a new code in Settings, which replaces this one.</string>
